==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shampoo (Enemy)|Shampoo]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Ranma Saotome (M) (Enemy)|Ranma Saotome (M)]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Although the Zombies may look intimidating, they are quite weak. That being said, no [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] units are necessary though [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu Cat]] will help quite a bit.

